{"path":"io/c/rename","title":"std::rename","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>rename","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/c/rename","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Changes the filename of a file. The file is identified by character string pointed to by old_filename. The new filename is identified by character string pointed to by new_filename.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdio\">&lt;cstdio&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> rename<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> old_filename, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> new_filename <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Changes the filename of a file. The file is identified by character string pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">old_filename</span></code>. The new filename is identified by character string pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">new_filename</span></code>.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">new_filename</span></code> exists, the behavior is implementation-defined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> old_filename\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to a null-terminated string containing the path identifying the file to rename\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> new_filename\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to a null-terminated string containing the new path of the file\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code> upon success or non-zero value on error.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/functions/rename.html\" data-external=\"1\">POSIX</a> specifies many additional details on the semantics of this function, which are reproduced in C++ by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/rename\">std::filesystem::rename</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdio&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ofstream\"><span class=\"kw1750\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ofstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"from.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">put</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'a'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// create and write to file</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/perror\"><span class=\"kw1890\">std::<span class=\"me2\">perror</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Error creating from.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw977\">EXIT_FAILURE</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">rename</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"from.txt\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"to.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/perror\"><span class=\"kw1890\">std::<span class=\"me2\">perror</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Error renaming\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw977\">EXIT_FAILURE</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ifstream\"><span class=\"kw1749\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ifstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"to.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// print file</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/EXIT_status\"><span class=\"kw976\">EXIT_SUCCESS</span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>a</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/rename\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rename</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(C++17)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  moves or renames a file or directory <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/remove\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>remove</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  erases a file <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/io/rename\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>rename</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/c","title":"C-style file input/output"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::rename","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Changes the filename of a file. The file is identified by character string pointed to by old_filename."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"old_filename, new_filename"},{"label":"Return value","note":"0 upon success or non-zero value on error."},{"label":"Notes","note":"POSIX specifies many additional details on the semantics of this function, which are reproduced in C++ by std::filesystem::rename."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"rename","note":"moves or renames a file or directory"},{"label":"remove","note":"erases a file"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":177,"codeBlockCount":2}
